<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in very heavy trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average fell 8.51 to 5,868.85.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 0.69 to 365.99, a record.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose 8 cents.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1,388 to 999.</p>
<p>Volume was 499,852,820, compared with 451,698,160 Wednesday.</p>
</text>
